    script: { lines: ["Let's move into Cat. Come to kneeling, facing the push-thru bar, arms long, torso vertical, bar at its highest position.", "Inhale to hinge your femurs and torso back away from vertical, arms staying straight; exhale, initiating from your head, to sequentially articulate into flexion.", "Let your head respond naturally as your spine flexes from the tail, and keep your shoulders above the level of the bar during the extension. Feel your erector spinae driving the extension and your obliques and glutes/hamstrings stabilizing the hinge."] },
