    focus: "Start with the spine as neutral as possible, not held in flexion with the pelvis in posterior tilt\nEngage scapular stabilizers to prevent the body weight sliding down through the shoulders\nInitiate thoracic extension with scapular stabilization\nEngage abdominals and deep neck flexors to prevent lumbar/cervical overextension\nArticulate sequentially through the spine on both roll up and roll down\nExtend the hips before the spine on the way up, and articulate through the spine before the hips on the way back to the starting position",
