    targetMuscles: "Transversus abdominis and pelvic floor\nObliques/erector spinae to stabilize the torso in neutral\nObliques/multifidus to resist over-rotation of the pelvis\nQuadriceps concentrically to extend the knee, eccentrically on return\nGastrocnemius/soleus concentrically to plantar flex the ankle, eccentrically on dorsiflexion\nLateral rotators to maintain rotation of the femur in the hip joint\nScapular stabilizers",
